{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10273020","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10273020","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1027302001:0":{"text":"쯧, 여기서 다시 만나다니 정말 공교로운걸.","source_cn":"啧，真是不巧啊，居然在这儿重逢了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x81AB50F52518A78A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1027302002:0":{"text":"당신은 그... 트레져 헌터! 어쩐지 목소리가 익숙하더라니!","source_cn":"你是那个——宝藏猎人！怪不得声音那么耳熟！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC51188AA3C980229","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1027302003:1":{"text":"숨겨진 보물을 찾으러 땅거미 숲에 왔다고 하더니... 그럼 <style=\"highlight\">사슴 영혼의 보물</style>이 목표겠군요?","source_cn":"我记得你说过，来薄暮丛林是为了寻找隐秘的宝藏……这么看...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2BB827A2D97D9F78","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1027302004:1":{"text":"으흠, 맞아. 이렇게 빨리 올 줄은 몰랐는데, 너희들도 이 분야에 꽤 소질이 있는걸?","source_cn":"嗯哼，没错，没想到你们居然来得这么快。看起来你们也挺有...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x015FE3A8BE432219","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1027302005:1":{"text":"좋아, 기왕 들켰으니 굳이 돌려서 말하지 않을게. 맞아, 난 이 보물 때문에 온 거야.","source_cn":"好吧，既然被你们发现了，那我也不绕弯子了。没错，我就是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF3FB2C3B8D6320A6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1027302006:1":{"text":"...안타깝게도 이곳에 도착해서야 여기 기믹에 문제가 있다는 걸 알게 됐고.","source_cn":"——很可惜，到了这边我才发现，这里的机关出了问题。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD47493FC95739C48","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:9:1027302006":{"text":"...안타깝게도 이곳에 도착해서야 여기 기믹에 문제가 있다는 걸 알게 됐고.","source_cn":"——很可惜，到了这边我才发现，这里的机关出了问题。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD47493FC95739C48","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1027302007:1":{"text":"몰라. 어쨌든, 한참 동안 만지작거렸는데 작동이 안 돼.","source_cn":"天晓得，反正我摆弄了半天都没反应。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x123202894AA3EB49","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1027302010:1":{"text":"근데 정말 이상하네. 보통, 신의 이름으로 존재하는 고대 기믹은 문제가 생길 리 없는데, 이건 왜 이럴까?","source_cn":"不过，真是奇怪啊。照理说，这种以神之名存留的古代机关通...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x24917D3DB5585D62","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1027302011:1":{"text":"너무 오래돼서 녹이 슬었나?","source_cn":"难不成年久失修，生锈了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5C97F38FBD4E708A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1027302012:1":{"text":"무슨 소리야?! 사슴 영혼이 남긴 물건이 어떻게 녹이 슬어?!","source_cn":"你在胡说什么？！鹿灵留下的东西怎么可能生锈？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC43F3855856F2B55","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1027302013:1":{"text":"아... 일리가 있네. 여기 기믹은 모두 나무로 만들었으니 이끼가 끼어서 썩은 거겠지.","source_cn":"啊——很有道理，这里的机关都是木制，要说的话也是长了苔...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x925B73105FD478CC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1027302014:1":{"text":"너...! 감히 사슴 영혼에 불경한 소리를!","source_cn":"你——你这家伙！居然对鹿灵不敬！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBC956EC7912028B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1027302015:1":{"text":"아, 아니야, 난 그저 신보다 대자연의 법칙을 더 믿을 뿐이야.","source_cn":"不不不，只是比起神明，我更相信大自然的规律。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4DFA31DB4629B696","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1027302016:1":{"text":"못 믿겠다면 직접 가봐도 괜찮아. 눈으로 보는 게 더 확실하지 않겠어?","source_cn":"如果不相信我说的，为什么不亲自去看看呢？眼见为实嘛。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x88CB77A133719799","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:9:0:1":{"text":"어떤 의문?","source_cn":"什么问题？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x1D98D88280254379","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"어떤 의문?","female":"어떤 의문?","variant_male_record_index":"61256","variant_female_record_index":"61257","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1027302008:1":{"text":"그게 수수께끼여야 풀지! 기계 고장은 고칠 수 밖에 없잖아!","source_cn":"你也说了，那得是谜题。谜题才能解开，故障只能被维修。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x40DDB078EF546BEF","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"그게 수수께끼여야 풀지! 기계 고장은 고칠 수 밖에 없잖아!","female":"그게 수수께끼여야 풀지! 기계 고장은 고칠 수 밖에 없잖아!","variant_male_record_index":"109476","variant_female_record_index":"109477","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1027302009:1":{"text":"공교롭게도 난 기계 수리에 경험이 없어서 지금 연구 중이야.","source_cn":"不巧，我对修理这行暂时没多少涉猎，所以正在研究呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF78304B5CCC2F407","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:9:1:2":{"text":"너도 수수께끼를 못 풀었어?","source_cn":"你也会解不开谜题？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x0B58BE3175F1A363","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"너도 수수께끼를 못 풀었어?","female":"너도 수수께끼를 못 풀었어?","variant_male_record_index":"61258","variant_female_record_index":"61259","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:阿塔兰忒":{"text":"아탈란테","source":"阿塔兰忒","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:洛桑":{"text":"로잔","source":"洛桑","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:莱卡":{"text":"라이카","source":"莱卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":20,"localized_text_count":19,"speaker_count":3}}